WEBVTT

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:05.368
♪ Freeze

00:00:05.411 --> 00:00:06.978
♪

00:00:07.021 --> 00:00:08.371
[screaming, laughing]

00:00:09.285 --> 00:00:12.026
♪ Un, dos, tres, leggo.

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:13.027
[music stops]

00:00:13.071 --> 00:00:14.768
-Wow. -[giggles]
-Respect.

00:00:14.812 --> 00:00:16.248
-Respect.
-[grunts]

00:00:16.292 --> 00:00:18.076
-Why don't we split him?
-Huh?

00:00:18.119 --> 00:00:19.338
-Good idea. -Yeah.
-[laughter]

00:00:19.382 --> 00:00:21.688
Wait, wait, wait, wait,
wait, wait, wait.

00:00:21.732 --> 00:00:25.518
Why does Barb get to decide
which music gets to be saved?

00:00:25.562 --> 00:00:27.520
All music should be saved.

00:00:29.392 --> 00:00:32.308
All right, okay.
I'm listening, Pop Troll.

00:00:38.531 --> 00:00:41.926
FEMALE STRING VOICE:
♪ Oh, yeah.

00:00:42.753 --> 00:00:44.668
-[gasps]
-[panting]

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:46.931
Poppy, there you are.

00:00:46.974 --> 00:00:50.369
Hickory!
Oh, it's so good to see you.

00:00:50.413 --> 00:00:51.631
Where's Branch?

00:00:51.675 --> 00:00:53.416
We had a fight.
He's gone.

00:00:53.459 --> 00:00:54.895
He's heading back
to Pop Village.

00:00:54.939 --> 00:00:56.854
[sighs] That's a shame.

00:00:56.897 --> 00:00:58.116
[Poppy sighs]

00:00:58.159 --> 00:01:00.292
I was so desperate
to be a good queen

00:01:00.336 --> 00:01:03.948
that I stopped listening
to anyone but myself.

00:01:05.428 --> 00:01:07.517
Including my best friend.
[sighs]

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:10.650
And it's all because of
this stupid string.

00:01:10.694 --> 00:01:13.740
-[pop riff echoes]
-[magic jingling]

00:01:13.784 --> 00:01:16.743
Poppy, take the string
and run as fast as you can,

00:01:16.787 --> 00:01:17.831
-you hear me?
-What?

00:01:17.875 --> 00:01:19.093
What are you talking about?

00:01:19.137 --> 00:01:21.574
Trust me, just go.

00:01:21.618 --> 00:01:23.446
Now! Please! Just go!

00:01:23.489 --> 00:01:25.099
-[male voice grunting]
-Hickory, are you all right?

00:01:25.143 --> 00:01:26.710
-I'm fine.
-[male voice grumbling]

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:28.015
Hey. Hey, now!

00:01:28.059 --> 00:01:29.016
Stop that!

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:30.148
-[gasps]
-Here.

00:01:30.191 --> 00:01:32.019
-Oh, whoa, whoa!
-[male voice grunting]

00:01:32.846 --> 00:01:34.631
[Poppy shouts, gasps]

00:01:34.674 --> 00:01:36.763
-[grunts]
-[screams]

00:01:36.807 --> 00:01:38.722
-[grunts] Nein!
-[gasps]

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:39.940
What are you doing, Hickory?!

00:01:39.984 --> 00:01:41.377
-Quiet, Dickory!
-POPPY: What's going on?

00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:44.292
-Hickory?
-I am so sorry.

00:01:44.336 --> 00:01:45.119
[yells]

00:01:45.163 --> 00:01:46.556
DICKORY:
Yeah.

00:01:46.599 --> 00:01:49.341
Show her who you really are,
Hickory!

00:01:53.345 --> 00:01:55.521
["Hocus Pocus" playing,
Dickory yodeling]

00:01:57.523 --> 00:01:59.525
[Hickory vocalizing]

00:02:02.876 --> 00:02:04.835
[sings high-pitched note]

00:02:04.878 --> 00:02:07.141
Wait.

00:02:07.185 --> 00:02:08.795
You're the Yodelers?

00:02:08.839 --> 00:02:09.796
[chuckles]:
Yeah.

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:11.537
Ya darn skippy, playa-play.

00:02:11.581 --> 00:02:13.931
And you were gonna give
our string to Barb?

00:02:13.974 --> 00:02:17.978
Ding, ding. Give this person a
strudel for the correct answer.

00:02:18.022 --> 00:02:20.459
And you've been in back
the whole time?

00:02:21.329 --> 00:02:23.723
Next subject, please.

00:02:23.767 --> 00:02:25.595
Why would you do this?

00:02:26.465 --> 00:02:27.858
[German accent]:
So sorry.

00:02:27.901 --> 00:02:31.339
Uh, it was the only way to save
our beautiful yodeling.

00:02:31.383 --> 00:02:32.819
Hickory.

00:02:32.863 --> 00:02:35.169
But trust me, you need to get
out of here right away.

00:02:35.213 --> 00:02:36.475
What are you doing, Hickory?

00:02:36.519 --> 00:02:37.824
-Nein! -Dickory.
-[grunts]

00:02:37.868 --> 00:02:38.825
Shut your mouth-hole, please!

00:02:38.869 --> 00:02:40.653
-Let go!
-[grunting]

00:02:40.697 --> 00:02:42.438
-We must save yodeling!
-Stop it! -Got you!

00:02:42.481 --> 00:02:44.701
-[shouts]
-[laughs]

00:02:44.744 --> 00:02:48.139
-I thought I heard a yodel.
-[gasps] Queen Barb.

00:02:49.357 --> 00:02:51.577
-[pop riff plays]
-[Poppy gasps]

00:02:51.621 --> 00:02:53.361
The final notes of Pop.

00:02:53.405 --> 00:02:56.321
It will never invade
anyone's brain again.

00:02:56.364 --> 00:02:58.454
I'm not gonna let you do this!

00:03:03.589 --> 00:03:05.852
This is who I've been
worried about?

00:03:05.896 --> 00:03:07.680
This little pipsqueak?

00:03:07.724 --> 00:03:10.553
I'll never stop fighting
until I make things right.

00:03:10.596 --> 00:03:12.555
-And I'm not a pipsqueak!
-Uh, yeah, you are,

00:03:12.598 --> 00:03:14.513
'cause I'm, like, a whole
centimeter taller than you.

00:03:14.557 --> 00:03:16.297
No! [grunts]
Leave me alone!

00:03:16.341 --> 00:03:18.474
Leave you alone?
Uh, I'm sorry.

00:03:18.517 --> 00:03:21.041
You were the one who was all
desperate to be best friends.

00:03:21.085 --> 00:03:23.130
Get your hands off me.

00:03:23.174 --> 00:03:24.305
Oh, okay. All right.

00:03:24.349 --> 00:03:25.872
You're feisty.
I respect that.

00:03:25.916 --> 00:03:28.179
Strong woman to strong woman,
am I right?

00:03:28.222 --> 00:03:30.311
But you know
who else was feisty?

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:33.489
Pop Village.

00:03:33.532 --> 00:03:34.925
[gasps]

00:03:34.968 --> 00:03:36.840
Oh, no. No!

00:03:37.884 --> 00:03:40.104
[panting]

00:03:41.105 --> 00:03:42.672
Everyone! Everyone!

00:03:42.715 --> 00:03:43.977
We're back!

00:03:44.021 --> 00:03:45.239
[gasps]

00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:48.504
[gasps] Oh, no.

00:03:51.594 --> 00:03:53.552
-Biggie! You won't believe it!
-Hello, Biggie.

00:03:53.596 --> 00:03:56.555
We were attacked
by Barb and her barbarians!

00:03:56.599 --> 00:03:58.949
She took everybody
to Volcano Rock City.

00:03:58.992 --> 00:04:00.298
It was scary.

00:04:00.341 --> 00:04:01.560
Rock me, Daddy.

00:04:01.604 --> 00:04:03.127
Mm, that's nice.

00:04:04.955 --> 00:04:07.523
♪

00:04:09.481 --> 00:04:12.266
I shouldn't have left her.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:14.051
She wouldn't have left me.

00:04:14.094 --> 00:04:16.401
Never, no matter
how scared she was.

00:04:17.315 --> 00:04:20.100
I've got to go back.

00:04:20.144 --> 00:04:22.668
We're coming with you, Biggie.

00:04:22.712 --> 00:04:25.279
We got to go save
our best friend.

00:04:25.323 --> 00:04:28.282
But how? We'll never
make it past security.

00:04:28.326 --> 00:04:30.589
We'll overpower them
with muscles!

00:04:30.633 --> 00:04:32.722
-[strains]
-[muscles squeak]

00:04:34.288 --> 00:04:37.074
Or... we could overpower them

00:04:37.117 --> 00:04:38.902
-with fashion.
-With fashion.

00:04:38.945 --> 00:04:41.339
♪

00:04:45.648 --> 00:04:47.127
Ouch.

00:04:47.171 --> 00:04:48.346
[whimpers]:
Oh.

00:04:49.956 --> 00:04:51.305
Ooh.

00:04:51.349 --> 00:04:53.133
[rock music playing]

00:04:53.177 --> 00:04:56.659
Rock and roll! [laughs]

